# Who may log in where, and as which account. Applied by every `sys sync`.
#
#   machine            account   may be logged into from
#
# Names are each machine's hostname. Aliases drop the shared "dwkns-" so
# `ssh mini-m1` reaches dwkns-mini-m1. Public keys live in keys/NAME.pub and
# are shared automatically; private keys never leave their machine.
#
# dwkns-iphone is Termius on the phone. It only logs in, so it has no line of
# its own: just its public key in keys/dwkns-iphone.pub, added by hand.

dwkns-mbp-m5         dwkns     dwkns-mini-m1  dwkns-iphone
dwkns-mini-m1        dwkns     dwkns-mbp-m5  dwkns-mbp-ubuntu  dwkns-iphone
dwkns-mbp-ubuntu     admin     dwkns-mbp-m5  dwkns-mini-m1  dwkns-iphone
dwkns-smb-nas        dwkns     dwkns-mbp-m5  dwkns-mini-m1  dwkns-mbp-ubuntu  dwkns-iphone
